# hooks/ standard

Read [`skills/hooks-standard/SKILL.md`](../skills/hooks-standard/SKILL.md) before adding files under `hooks/`.

- One domain folder per module: `hooks/wallet/`, `hooks/live/`, `hooks/bucket/`
- camelCase filenames with `use` prefix: `useWalletData.ts` — no kebab-case at hooks root
- SWR + React only — pure helpers go in `lib/`, canister calls in `services/`
- Import: `@/hooks/<module>/use<Name>` — never `@/hooks/use-wallet-data` style flat paths
